<section>
    <section id="test17">
        <h2>Text spacing</h2>
        <p>Is the content still completely readable after inscreasing spacing ? :</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Line height (line spacing): at least 1.5 times font size;</li>
            <li>Space following paragraphs: at least 2 times font size;</li>
            <li>Letter spacing (tracking): at least 0.12 times font size;</li>
            <li>Word spacing: at least 0.16 times font size.</li>
        </ul>
        <p><a target="tweede" href="https://developer.paciellogroup.com/blog/2018/05/short-note-on-getting-spaced-out-with-sc-1-4-12-text-spacing/">Use a bookmarklet to test</a></p>
    </section>


    <section>
        <h2>Example: Sporza</h2>
        <img class="stretch"  src="https://images.anysurfer.be/text_spacing/sporza_normal.png" alt="text under a photo with standard spacing">
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>Example: Sporza with more spaces (not OK)</h2>
        <img class="stretch" src="https://images.anysurfer.be/text_spacing/sporza_text_spacing.png" alt="Texte plus espacé, partiellement troncqué">
    </section>

</section>
